OL,3,GNEWSAThe questions Andy Burnham
OL,4,Aanswered in Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has set out
OL,7,Fa number of priorities during his visit
OL,8,Fto West Yorkshire on Thursday.
OL,10,FSpeaking at a waste dump in Bradford,
OL,11,Fhe said he would crack down on
OL,12,Ffly-tipping and look into equipping
OL,13,Ffire and rescue services with more
OL,14,Fresources to tackle wildfires and
OL,15,Fflooding.
OL,17,FHe also spoke about plans to boost
OL,18,Finfrastructure and support British
OL,19,Ffarming.
OL,21,FBelow are the four questions he
OL,22,Fanswered from BBC Yorkshire.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
